        role: "Skater",
        exam: [.direct("How do you know {D} and {V}?", "\"I skate at the same park. I was in the bowl that day, and I was wearing a helmet camera, as I do most sessions, to review my tricks.\""), .direct("What did your helmet camera record?", "\"An argument at the lip of the bowl over who had dropped in out of turn, and then {D} shoving {V} backward against the concrete edge.\""), .direct("What was the argument about?", "\"Turns. The bowl is crowded, and we take turns dropping in. {D} thought {V} cut ahead, and {V} said it was {V}'s turn.\""), .direct("What happened when {D} shoved {V}?", "\"{V} went back against the lip of the bowl and hit {V}'s chin on the edge. It split open and bled a lot.\""), .direct("How did {V} look afterward?", "\"Dazed, with blood running down the neck. A few people helped {V} sit down, and someone called for a ride to urgent care.\""), .direct("Did you see a scooter during the argument?", "\"Yes. {V} had a scooter at the side, and at one point {V} lifted it. I saw it raised, but it did not hit anyone.\""), .cross("The scooter never connected with {D}, did it?", "\"No. It was raised, and I did not see it connect. {D} was not hit by it.\""), .cross("Both of them stepped toward each other, didn't they?", "\"I think so. It happened quickly. {D} walked toward {V}, and {V} stepped in as well.\""), .cross("{V} was loud, wasn't {V}?", "\"Yes. Both were loud. I could not make out every word, but the tone was heated on both sides.\""), .cross("You did not see {V} cut in front of {D}, did you?", "\"I was waiting at the other side. I do not know who was first. I only saw the argument start.\""), .cross("A scooter raised in anger could look threatening, couldn't it?", "\"It could. I understand why {D} reacted, though I cannot say the push was needed.\"")],
