        defendant: [.direct("Did you shoot at {V}'s home?", "\"No. I did not. I was in bed at home, and I did not leave the house that night. I have never fired at anyone.\""), .direct("Why did you leave angry voicemails for {V}?", "\"We had a painful breakup, and I was upset about money and things we shared. I said things I should not have, and I regret every one.\""), .direct("What happened to your revolver?", "\"I sold it months before. I did not want it in the house after the breakup, and I took it to a buyer I met through a friend.\""), .direct("Where is the receipt for the sale?", "\"I gave it to the deputy. It is dated before the shooting and has the buyer's signature. I do not have the buyer's contact.\""), .direct("Why was there residue on your car door handle?", "\"I do not know. My car sits outside, and people walk by. I did not fire a gun from it, and I was not in it that night.\""), .direct("What do you want {V} to know?", "\"That I am sorry I hurt {V}, and that I am glad {V} is okay. I did not do this, and I hope the truth comes out.\""), .cross("You left angry voicemails for a month, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. I was furious and I said ugly things. I should have stopped.\""), .cross("The revolver in the creek was the one you owned, wasn't it?", "\"It looks like the same model. I sold mine months ago, and I do not know how it ended up there.\""), .cross("You cannot name the buyer, can you?", "\"I have a first name and no phone number. I wish I had gotten more, and I understand how it looks.\""), .cross("Your car had gunshot residue on the door handle, didn't it?", "\"That is what they say. I do not know how it got there, and I did not do it.\""), .cross("You were angry at {V} and you owned a revolver, weren't you?", "\"Yes, I was angry. I owned one, and I sold it. I did not use it.\"")],
