        role: "Victim",
        exam: [.direct("What happened at the bowling alley on {DATE}?", "\"After a league match, {D} and I argued about a foul line call. {D} stepped up and punched me in the face, and my nose started to bleed.\""), .direct("What was the argument about?", "\"Whether a bowler had stepped over the foul line on a key frame. I thought the call was right, and {D} disagreed loudly.\""), .direct("What did you say to {D} before the punch?", "\"I raised my voice and said the call was correct. I may have said it sharply, and I told {D} to let it go.\""), .direct("How serious was your injury?", "\"My nose bled badly, and I had a swollen eye. I went to urgent care, and I had pain for a couple of weeks.\""), .direct("What did you do after the punch?", "\"I held my face and stepped back. A teammate gave me a towel, and the alley manager called the sheriff's office.\""), .direct("Did you know {D} had a history?", "\"I found out later that {D} had two earlier assault convictions. I did not know that when we argued.\""), .cross("You yelled about the call, didn't you?", "\"Yes, I raised my voice. I was frustrated, and I may have been loud.\""), .cross("You lifted your ball bag during the argument, didn't you?", "\"I lifted it to shield my face when {D} came toward me. I did not swing it at anyone.\""), .cross("You stepped forward before the punch, didn't you?", "\"One step. I was trying to speak over the noise, and I did not mean to threaten {D}.\""), .cross("The bag stayed on your shoulder until after the punch, correct?", "\"Yes. It was on my shoulder, and I raised a hand to protect myself after the punch started.\""), .cross("The two of you have argued before, haven't you?", "\"Not like this. We have disagreed over calls, but it never became physical until that day.\"")],
