        exam: [.direct("What did you find when you arrived at {V}'s home at about 3:30 a.m.?", "\"{D} asleep in a recliner on {V}'s screened porch. A dog next door had been barking, and {V} called after being woken up.\""), .direct("How did {D} appear?", "\"Heavily intoxicated. {D} smelled strongly of liquor, was slow to wake, and had trouble standing when I helped {D} up.\""), .direct("What did the porch camera show?", "\"{D} unlatching the screen door at 2:55 a.m., walking in, and settling into the recliner. {D} did not knock or call out.\""), .direct("What did {V} tell you about the past between {V} and {D}?", "\"That there had been a quarrel over a shared driveway. A month before, {V} told {D} to stay off the property.\""), .direct("How are the two houses laid out?", "\"They are twins, the same model with the same screened porch on the same side. They sit side by side with a driveway between.\""), .direct("What did {D} say to you?", "\"That {D} thought it was {D}'s own porch. {D} said {D.he} had been out drinking and walked home in the dark.\""), .cross("{D} did not resist you, did {D.he}?", "\"No. {D} was cooperative and a little confused. {D} apologized when I explained where {D.he} was.\""), .cross("The houses look very similar, don't they?", "\"Yes. They are nearly identical. I could see how someone in the dark could confuse them.\""), .cross("{D}'s own porch light was out, wasn't it?", "\"I noticed that. It was dark in front of {D}'s house. {V}'s porch light was on.\""), .cross("{D} had been drinking heavily, hadn't {D.he}?", "\"Yes. {D} was clearly intoxicated. That is a part of why I thought it could be a mistake.\""), .cross("{D} did not take anything from the porch, did {D.he}?", "\"No. Nothing was missing or disturbed. {D} fell asleep in the recliner and did nothing else.\"")],
