        defendant: [.direct("Did you go into {V}'s porch?", "\"Yes. By mistake. I thought it was my own porch. I was drunk and walked right in without looking.\""), .direct("Why did you think it was your own house?", "\"The houses are twins. The porch looked the same in the dark, and I had been drinking for hours at a bar.\""), .direct("Where was your own porch light?", "\"It was out. I had been meaning to replace the bulb. I walked toward the one house with a light on and assumed it was mine.\""), .direct("What did you do once you were inside?", "\"I sat down in a recliner and fell asleep. I did not touch anything, and I did not know whose it was.\""), .direct("What had you been doing that night?", "\"I was at a bar with friends. I walked home because I did not want to drive. I should have taken a ride.\""), .direct("What would you say to {V}?", "\"That I am sorry. I would never have gone near your house on purpose, and I will do whatever I can to make it right.\""), .cross("{V} had told you to stay away from the property, hadn't {V}?", "\"Yes. A month earlier. I remember it. I was not thinking about it that night.\""), .cross("You walked past your own door to get to {V}'s, didn't you?", "\"I walked toward a light. I thought it was mine. I did not look at the doors.\""), .cross("You were drunk, weren't you?", "\"Yes. I was very drunk. I take responsibility for being that drunk.\""), .cross("You unlatched a screen door and walked in, didn't you?", "\"I did. I did not realize it was not my own door.\""), .cross("You were angry at {V} about the driveway, weren't you?", "\"Yes. We had a quarrel. I would not have gone there on purpose.\"")],
        openings: ("{V} was woken at 3:30 a.m. by a barking dog and found {D}, who smelled of liquor, asleep in a recliner on {V}'s porch. {V} had told {D} to stay away a month earlier.", "{D} was drunk and walked into the wrong porch in the dark, because the two houses are twins. {D} was not trespassing on purpose."),
