        openings: ("After a dispute over a $900 alignment bill, {D} swung a hammer across a tire shop counter and broke {V}'s collarbone. {D} left in a van. A shop camera recorded it.", "{D} says {V} lunged across the counter and the hammer was already in {D.his} hand from the bay. It was a swing out of fear."),
