        defenseRole: "Defendant's cousin",
        defenseExam: [.direct("How are you related to {D}?", "\"I am {D}'s cousin. We grew up close and see each other at family events. I know {D} well.\""), .direct("Did you have {D}'s truck on the night of {DATE}?", "\"No. I did not. {D} did not lend it to me that night, and I did not have the keys.\""), .direct("Where were you that night?", "\"Out of town. I was visiting relatives a few hours away. I have receipts and photos that show where I was.\""), .direct("Did {D} ask you about the truck?", "\"Later, yes. {D} asked if I had borrowed it, and I said no. {D} seemed confused.\""), .direct("What kind of person is {D}?", "\"Quiet and kind. {D} has never hurt anyone that I know of. I cannot imagine {D} doing this.\""), .direct("What did you do when you heard about the abduction?", "\"I told {D} to tell the police where {D} was. I knew I could not help with the truck, but I could say I was away.\""), .cross("You do not know who had the truck, do you?", "\"No. I only know that I did not have it. I cannot say who did.\""), .cross("You are close to {D}, aren't you?", "\"Yes. I care about {D}. I am telling the truth, even if it does not help.\""), .cross("{D} told people the truck was lent to you, didn't {D.he}?", "\"I heard that. It is not true, and I told {D} so.\""), .cross("You were out of town that night, weren't you?", "\"Yes. I have proof. I was hours away and could not have driven that truck.\""), .cross("You cannot say where {D} was at 7:10, can you?", "\"No. I was not with {D}. I only know where I was.\"")],
