        openings: ("At 7:10 p.m., someone grabbed {V} outside a pharmacy and forced {V.him} into a black pickup. {V} jumped out at a stop sign and picked {D} out of a lineup. The truck is registered to {D}.", "{D} was at a hardware store across town at 7:10, and a camera shows it. {V} made an honest but mistaken identification."),
